          / Turniput Lamp Control
          section#lamp-control.mb-12
            h2.text-3xl.font-bold.text-gray-900.mb-6 Turniput Lamp Control
            .bg-gradient-to-r.from-purple-50.to-blue-50.rounded-xl.p-8.mb-8.border.border-purple-200
              p.text-lg.text-gray-700.mb-6
                | If you are using the Turniput with a button that has an LED in it, our lamp controls allow you to enable the status of the LED depending on the Turniput status - On, Off or Breathe.

              .grid.md:grid-cols-3.gap-6
                .text-center
                  .bg-white.rounded-full.p-4.w-16.h-16.mx-auto.mb-4.flex.items-center.justify-center
                    .w-8.h-8.bg-green-500.rounded-full
                  h4.font-semibold.text-gray-900.mb-2 On
                  p.text-sm.text-gray-600 LED stays lit
                .text-center
                  .bg-white.rounded-full.p-4.w-16.h-16.mx-auto.mb-4.flex.items-center.justify-center
                    .w-8.h-8.bg-gray-400.rounded-full
                  h4.font-semibold.text-gray-900.mb-2 Off
                  p.text-sm.text-gray-600 LED stays off
                .text-center
                  .bg-white.rounded-full.p-4.w-16.h-16.mx-auto.mb-4.flex.items-center.justify-center
                    .w-8.h-8.bg-blue-500.rounded-full.animate-pulse
                  h4.font-semibold.text-gray-900.mb-2 Breathe
                  p.text-sm.text-gray-600 LED pulses slowly

          / FPP Integration
          section#fpp-integration.mb-12
            h2.text-3xl.font-bold.text-gray-900.mb-6 FPP Integration
            p.text-lg.text-gray-700.mb-6
              | The Turnip network automatically detects FPP instances on your network and using the API will seamlessly pull in playlists and sequences allowing you to start a show, manage the volume and/or play a specific (or random) song at the touch of a button.
            p.text-lg.text-gray-700
              | If you like to get your hands dirty with the FPP commands, Turniputs give you full access to all of them from within the Baldrick interface.

          / Web Hook Integration
          section#webhook-integration.mb-12
            h2.text-3xl.font-bold.text-gray-900.mb-6 Web Hook Integration
            p.text-lg.text-gray-700
              | When an input is triggered you can send a GET request to a specific URL (either on your network or over the internet) perfect for logging or any other online effects you have for your show.

          / Learn More
          .mt-8.bg-gray-50.rounded-lg.p-6.border.border-gray-200
            h4.text-lg.font-semibold.text-gray-900.mb-3 Learn More About Baldrick
            p.text-gray-700.mb-4
              | Discover how Turniput integrates with other Baldrick products and the broader ecosystem.
            .grid.md:grid-cols-2.gap-4
              = link_to "The Turnip Network", breakthroughs_turnip_network_path, class: "inline-block bg-purple-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-md hover:bg-purple-700 transition-colors"
              = link_to "Baldrick Boards", boards_path, class: "inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-md hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors"
